// endpoint_list_merged_workspaces.proto — ListMergedWorkspaces: one page of
// merged workspaces' rows. SIDEBAR section. A pull, answered at once.
//
// A MERGED WORKSPACE IS IN NO ROSTER STREAM (frontend.v1.RosterPush): it is
// finished, and the roster carries only the Recently Merged band's summary
// (frontend.v1.RosterMergedSection). Its row is fetched here, ten at a time,
// by whoever draws or reads it: the sidebar while the band is unfolded (each
// group's first page, then the next as the reader scrolls to the group's
// end), and the editor's switcher and name lookups.
//
